OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes through newly reopened
OL,4,Abutcher's shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has crashed through the front
OL,7,Fof a village butcher's just days after
OL,8,Fit reopened following a major
OL,9,Frefurbishment.
OL,11,FThe vehicle ploughed into the front
OL,12,Fwindow of Eric Lyons Butchers on
OL,13,FStation Road in Balsall Common, near
OL,14,FCoventry, just after 12:00 GMT.
OL,16,FNick Lyons, from the family-run
OL,17,Fbusiness that dates back to the 1800s,
OL,18,Fsaid the crash caused extensive damage,
OL,19,Fwith the car going through "90% of the
OL,20,Ffront of the shop". The premises will
OL,21,Fnow be shut for repairs until January.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
