OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes through newly reopened
OL,4,Abutcher's shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a Facebook post, Lyons said a
OL,7,Fcustomer and two staff members were
OL,8,Finside the shop at the time but nobody
OL,9,Fwas hurt. West Midlands Ambulance
OL,10,FService said a woman was assessed but
OL,11,Fdischarged at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
